+    Raises:
+        ValueError: If ``tensor``'s dtype is not one of the supported
+            dtypes, ``substate``/``scaling_method`` is not recognized,
+            ``rh`` is set for an unsupported ``conv`` combination, or ``rh``
+            is set and the resulting transform length is not a power of 2.
